research/audit/wave7-real-analysis-series.proof-contracts.json:3517:          "claim": "So for that sequence the root test gives convergence of $\\sum_{k \\ge 1} |a_k|$ while neither half of the ratio test applies, and the converse of claims 1 and 2 fails.",
