research/audit/wave7-proof-contracts.json:18322:          "claim": "Suppose $\\limsup_k q_k < 1$. By the chain, $\\limsup_k \\rho_k \\le \\limsup_k q_k < 1$, so the root test applies to the family $(a_k)_{k \\ge 1}$ and gives convergence of $\\sum_{k \\ge 1}|a_k|$ and of $\\sum_{k \\ge 1} a_k$, hence of $\\sum |a_k|$ and of $\\sum a_k$; the ratio test gives the same conclusions. That is claim 1.",
