research/audit/wave7-proof-contracts.json:18333:          "claim": "Suppose $\\liminf_k q_k > 1$. By the chain and [L2], $\\limsup_k \\rho_k \\ge \\liminf_k \\rho_k \\ge \\liminf_k q_k > 1$, so the root test gives divergence of $\\sum_{k \\ge 1} a_k$, hence of $\\sum a_k$; the ratio test gives the same conclusion. That is claim 2.",
