research/audit/wave7-A3.md-126-   `a_k=1/(k(log k)^c)`, the ratio has the next term
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-127-   `c/(k log k)` and convergence changes at `c=1`; that error is therefore
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-128-   load-bearing at the Gauss boundary. The classical `O(k^-beta)`, `beta>1`,
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-129-   condition is supported by the cited analysis text, and replacing beta by a
research/audit/wave7-A3.md-130-   smaller rational `1+epsilon` loses no covered case.
